{{Nihongo|'''Suzuya Island'''|鈴谷島|Susuya-jima}} is an island in [[Southeast Fosia]]. Its north coast lies 18 km southwest of [[Nankaido]] and south coast lies 60 km southeast of Mainland [[Fosia]]
